 "LibreMaps has no account, no ads and no analytics. It only talks to these open services, and only when you use the feature:\n\n• Map tiles and fonts: OpenFreeMap (tiles.openfreemap.org) sees the map area you view.\n• Search: Photon by Komoot (photon.komoot.io) sees what you type.\n• Routes for walk, bike and car: FOSSGIS Valhalla (valhalla1.openstreetmap.de) sees your start and end points.\n• Public transport: Transitous (api.transitous.org) sees your start and end points.\n• Places nearby (Food, Coffee, Fuel and the other shortcuts): an Overpass server and Photon (or Nominatim at openstreetmap.org if Photon finds nothing) see the area you search.\n• Place details (opening hours, phone): Nominatim at openstreetmap.org (or an Overpass server if it has nothing) sees the name and area of the place you open. For fuel stations in Spain, prices and hours come from the Ministry for Ecological Transition (sedeaplicaciones.minetur.gob.es), which is asked for a whole province at a time and so only sees the province.\n• Speed limits: Valhalla sees your position while you drive, if Road alerts is on.\n• Offline maps: OpenFreeMap (tiles.openfreemap.org) sees the areas you save, and Nominatim at openstreetmap.org sees the centre of each one, to give it a name. Without internet, search, nearby places and routes come from your saved areas on the phone.\n• Speed cameras: an Overpass server (overpass.kumi.systems, maps.mail.ru or overpass-api.de) sees the outline of your route, if Road alerts is on.\n• Approximate position when GPS has no fix: ipwho.is sees your IP address, if that option is on.\n• Official traffic incidents in Spain: the DGT's open data feed (nap.dgt.es) is downloaded whole, so it learns nothing about where you are, if Traffic alerts is on.\n• Reports by other drivers: the Nostr relays relay.damus.io, nos.lol, relay.primal.net and offchain.pub see the area you're looking at or driving through, if Traffic alerts is on. A report you send is public: it holds the spot, your direction and the time, signed with a one-use key so your reports can't be linked to each other. Like every server listed here, the relays see your IP address.\n\nRoad alerts and the approximate position can be switched off in Preferences. Your last known position is stored only on the phone.": "LibreMaps 没有账号、没有广告，也没有统计分析。它只会与以下开放服务通信，并且仅在您使用相应功能时：\n\n• 地图图块和字体：OpenFreeMap (tiles.openfreemap.org) 能看到您查看的地图区域。\n• 搜索：Komoot 的 Photon (photon.komoot.io) 能看到您输入的内容。\n• 步行、骑行和驾车路线：FOSSGIS Valhalla (valhalla1.openstreetmap.de) 能看到您的起点和终点。\n• 公共交通：Transitous (api.transitous.org) 能看到您的起点和终点。\n• 附近地点（餐饮、咖啡、加油及其他快捷方式）：Overpass 服务器和 Photon（如果 Photon 找不到，则为 openstreetmap.org 上的 Nominatim）能看到您搜索的区域。\n• 地点详情（营业时间、电话）：openstreetmap.org 上的 Nominatim（如果它没有信息，则为 Overpass 服务器）能看到您打开的地点的名称和所在区域。对于西班牙的加油站，价格和营业时间来自生态转型部（sedeaplicaciones.minetur.gob.es），每次请求的是整个省份的数据，因此它只能看到省份。\n• 限速：如果开启了道路提醒，Valhalla 会在您驾驶时看到您的位置。\n• 离线地图：OpenFreeMap (tiles.openfreemap.org) 能看到您保存的区域，openstreetmap.org 上的 Nominatim 能看到每个区域的中心，用于为其命名。没有网络时，搜索、附近地点和路线都来自手机上保存的区域。\n• 测速摄像头：如果开启了道路提醒，Overpass 服务器 (overpass.kumi.systems、maps.mail.ru 或 overpass-api.de) 能看到您路线的轮廓。\n• 无 GPS 定位时的大致位置：如果开启了该选项，ipwho.is 能看到您的 IP 地址。\n• 西班牙官方交通事件：如果开启了交通提醒，DGT 的开放数据源 (nap.dgt.es) 会被整体下载，因此它不会得知您的所在位置。\n• 其他驾驶员的报告：如果开启了交通提醒，Nostr 中继 relay.damus.io、nos.lol、relay.primal.net 和 offchain.pub 能看到您正在查看或驾车经过的区域。您发送的报告是公开的：它包含地点、您的方向和时间，并使用一次性密钥签名，因此您的各条报告之间无法相互关联。与这里列出的所有服务器一样，中继也能看到您的 IP 地址。\n\n道路提醒和大致位置可在偏好中关闭。您最后已知的位置仅保存在手机上。",
 "Fuel prices (%1)": "燃油价格（%1）",
 "Traffic alerts: official incidents (Spain, France, Germany) and reports by other drivers (Nostr relays)": "交通提醒：官方事件（西班牙、法国、德国）和其他驾驶员的报告（Nostr 中继）",
 "Outside Spain, fuel prices and official traffic incidents come from each country's open data:\n\n• France: fuel prices from prix-carburants (data.economie.gouv.fr), asked about the area of about 10 km that the station you open is in. Official incidents on national roads from Bison Futé (tipi.bison-fute.gouv.fr), downloaded whole, if Traffic alerts is on.\n• Germany: official motorway incidents from the Autobahn API (verkehr.autobahn.de), which is asked only about the motorways near your route, if Traffic alerts is on.\n• Italy (MIMIT, mimit.gov.it), Portugal (DGEG, precoscombustiveis.dgeg.gov.pt) and Mexico (Comisión Nacional de Energía, publicacionexterna.azurewebsites.net): fuel prices from national files downloaded whole, so they learn nothing about where you are.\n• Austria: fuel prices from E-Control (api.e-control.at), asked about the area of about 1 km around the station. By law it only publishes the cheaper stations, so the others show no prices.\n• Slovenia: fuel prices from goriva.si, asked about the area of about 5 km around the station.\n\nFuel prices are only looked up when you open a fuel station.": "在西班牙以外，燃油价格和官方交通事件来自各国的开放数据：\n\n• 法国：燃油价格来自 prix-carburants（data.economie.gouv.fr），查询的是你打开的加油站所在的约 10 公里区域。国道上的官方事件来自 Bison Futé（tipi.bison-fute.gouv.fr），在开启交通提醒时整体下载。\n• 德国：高速公路官方事件来自 Autobahn API（verkehr.autobahn.de），在开启交通提醒时只查询你路线附近的高速公路。\n• 意大利（MIMIT，mimit.gov.it）、葡萄牙（DGEG，precoscombustiveis.dgeg.gov.pt）和墨西哥（Comisión Nacional de Energía，publicacionexterna.azurewebsites.net）：燃油价格来自整体下载的全国文件，因此它们不会得知你在哪里。\n• 奥地利：燃油价格来自 E-Control（api.e-control.at），查询的是加油站周围约 1 公里的区域。依法它只公布较便宜的加油站，因此其他加油站不显示价格。\n• 斯洛文尼亚：燃油价格来自 goriva.si，查询的是加油站周围约 5 公里的区域。\n\n只有在你打开加油站时才会查询燃油价格。"
}
